---
---
<section id="planes" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Planes diseñados para escalar</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        El diferenciador de precio es la complejidad de la operación. Ideal para sector gastronómico[cite: 1].
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Plan Básico -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 flex flex-col hover:border-blue-300 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Básico</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">Ideal para Panaderías o Pizzerías de mostrador[cite: 1].</p>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">$599</span>
          <span class="text-gray-500">/mes[cite: 1]</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1">
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> 1 caja / estación de cobro[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> Módulo POS, apertura de caja, tickets y alta de categorías/productos[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> Reportes de ventas diarios y mensuales[cite: 1]</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="w-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors">Elegir Básico</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Plan Profesional -->
      <div class="bg-blue-600 rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 flex flex-col transform md:-translate-y-4 relative">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2">
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 to-orange-500 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider py-1 px-3 rounded-full">Más Popular</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Profesional</h3>
        <p class="text-blue-200 text-sm mb-6">Ideal para Restaurantes con mesas[cite: 1].</p>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">$999</span>
          <span class="text-blue-200">/mes[cite: 1]</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1">
          <li class="flex text-white"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-300">✓</span> Hasta 3 estaciones (caja + 2 dispositivos)[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-white"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-300">✓</span> Módulo de roles y permisos activo[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-white"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-300">✓</span> Gestión de comandas y captura de gastos[cite: 1]</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="w-full bg-white text-blue-600 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors shadow-md">Elegir Profesional</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Plan Premium -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 flex flex-col hover:border-blue-300 transition-colors">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Premium</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-6">Con Delivery y Multisucursal[cite: 1].</p>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">$1,299</span>
          <span class="text-gray-500">/mes[cite: 1]</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1">
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> Estaciones ilimitadas[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> Módulo de pedidos para delivery[cite: 1]</li>
          <li class="flex text-gray-700"><span class="mr-2 text-blue-500">✓</span> Integración completa de clientes[cite: 1]</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="w-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 font-semibold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors">Elegir Premium</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>